The '''Trilon sector''' was a [[sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]] that sat on the frontier border of [[Wild Space]] and the [[Unknown Regions]]. It contained the [[Batuu system]], the location of the [[planet]] [[Batuu]].<ref name="GEStaff" />

